      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "vLLM / SGLang / TensorRT-LLM 怎么讲",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vLLM / SGLang / TensorRT-LLM 怎么讲",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "engine-compare-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1278,
      "y": 685,
      "width": 837.000000000001,
      "height": 56.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 12064,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "vLLM：PagedAttention 和 hash-based prefix cache 管 KV block。\nSGLang：RadixAttention 适合多轮、分支、agentic generation 的 prefix 复用。\nTensorRT-LLM：NVIDIA 侧优化 toolkit，关注 paged attention、in-flight batching、quantization、plugins。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "vLLM：PagedAttention 和 hash-based prefix cache 管 KV block。\nSGLang：RadixAttention 适合多轮、分支、agentic generation 的 prefix 复用。\nTensorRT-LLM：NVIDIA 侧优化 toolkit，关注 paged attention、in-flight batching、quantization、plugins。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
